    {
      "source": "Custom argument resolvers are invoked before built-in resolvers except for\nthose that rely on the presence of annotations (for example, <code>@RequestParameter</code>,\n<code>@PathVariable</code>, etc). The latter can be customized by configuring the\n<a href=\"../../mvc/method/annotation/RequestMappingHandlerAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet.mvc.method.annotation\"><code>RequestMappingHandlerAdapter</code></a> directly.",
      "translation": "自定义参数解析器会在内置解析器之前被调用，除了那些依赖于注解存在的解析器（例如，<code>@RequestParameter</code>、<code>@PathVariable</code> 等）。后者可以通过直接配置 <a href=\"../../mvc/method/annotation/RequestMappingHandlerAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet.mvc.method.annotation\"><code>RequestMappingHandlerAdapter</code></a> 来自定义。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Custom return value handlers are invoked before built-in ones except for\nthose that rely on the presence of annotations (for example, <code>@ResponseBody</code>,\n<code>@ModelAttribute</code>, etc). The latter can be customized by configuring the\n<a href=\"../../mvc/method/annotation/RequestMappingHandlerAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet.mvc.method.annotation\"><code>RequestMappingHandlerAdapter</code></a> directly.",
      "translation": "自定义返回值处理器会在内置处理器之前被调用，除了那些依赖于注解存在的处理器（例如 <code>@ResponseBody</code>、<code>@ModelAttribute</code> 等）。后者可以通过直接配置 <a href=\"../../mvc/method/annotation/RequestMappingHandlerAdapter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.servlet.mvc.method.annotation\"><code>RequestMappingHandlerAdapter</code></a> 来自定义。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Adding converters to the list turns off the default converters that would\notherwise be registered by default. Also see <a href=\"WebMvcConfigurationSupport.html#addDefaultHttpMessageConverters(java.util.List)\"><code>WebMvcConfigurationSupport.addDefaultHttpMessageConverters(List)</code></a>\nfor adding default message converters.",
      "translation": "向列表添加转换器会关闭默认转换器，否则这些转换器将按默认方式注册。另请参阅 <a href=\"WebMvcConfigurationSupport.html#addDefaultHttpMessageConverters(java.util.List)\"><code>WebMvcConfigurationSupport.addDefaultHttpMessageConverters(List)</code></a> 以添加默认消息转换器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Adding resolvers to the list turns off the default resolvers that would otherwise\nbe registered by default. Also see <a href=\"WebMvcConfigurationSupport.html#addDefaultHandlerExceptionResolvers(java.util.List,org.springframework.web.accept.ContentNegotiationManager)\"><code>WebMvcConfigurationSupport.addDefaultHandlerExceptionResolvers(List, ContentNegotiationManager)</code></a>\nthat can be used to add the default exception resolvers.",
      "translation": "向列表中添加解析器会关闭默认解析器，否则这些解析器会被默认注册。另请参阅<a href=\"WebMvcConfigurationSupport.html#addDefaultHandlerExceptionResolvers(java.util.List,org.springframework.web.accept.ContentNegotiationManager)\"><code>WebMvcConfigurationSupport.addDefaultHandlerExceptionResolvers(List, ContentNegotiationManager)</code></a>，该接口可用于添加默认异常解析器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This may be useful for example to allow default resolvers to be registered\nand then insert a custom one through this method.",
      "translation": "这可能很有用，例如允许注册默认解析器，然后通过此方法插入一个自定义的解析器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A subclass of <code>WebMvcConfigurationSupport</code> that detects and delegates\nto all beans of type <a href=\"WebMvcConfigurer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.servlet.config.annotation\"><code>WebMvcConfigurer</code></a> allowing them to customize the\nconfiguration provided by <code>WebMvcConfigurationSupport</code>. This is the\nclass actually imported by <a href=\"EnableWebMvc.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.web.servlet.config.annotation\"><code>@EnableWebMvc</code></a>.",
      "translation": "`WebMvcConfigurationSupport` 的子类，用于检测并委托给所有类型为<a href=\"WebMvcConfigurer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.servlet.config.annotation\"><code>WebMvcConfigurer</code></a>的 Bean，允许它们自定义由<code>WebMvcConfigurationSupport</code>提供的配置。这是实际被<a href=\"EnableWebMvc.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.web.servlet.config.annotation\"><code>@EnableWebMvc</code></a>导入的类。",
      "count": 2
    },
